From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Victor Momplet <mompletvictor@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 19:28:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] chore: quieter Food and Health screens

No subtitle or privacy footnote on Food, "Tu gasto real" only once it has a figure, and no Scale card
until there is a reading. The explanations live in LEEME.md; the wearer asked for clean screens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
